{'symbol': 'ABMD', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Abiomed, Inc., Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'Abiomed, Inc., Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Minnesota Housing Now Live on Mortgage Cadence Enterprise Lending Center', 'text': "Minnesota Housing has implemented the Enterprise Lending Center (ELC) from Mortgage Cadence, an Accenture company, and is now committing loans on the loan-origination platform. ELC facilitates lending in all mortgage channels retail, wholesale and correspondent across all mortgage products, including conventional forward mortgages as well as reverse mortgages, which can help older homeowners leverage the equity in their property to support retirement. Mortgage Cadence helped Minnesota Housing a state housing agency dedicated to reducing racial and ethnic disparity in homeownership custom-configure the platform to provide the agency's lending team with the most efficient workflow. Minnesota Housing is also taking advantage of Mortgage Cadence's imaging functionality to quickly recognize, classify and store documents from borrowers and lending partners, ultimately increasing the speed of internal processes."}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Air Products and Chemicals, Inc. Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-13-2019 through Oct-15-2019', 'text': 'Air Products and Chemicals, Inc. Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-13-2019 through Oct-15-2019. Venue: Taj Palace, New Delhi, Delhi, India. Presentation Date & Speakers: Oct-14-2019, Seifi Ghasemi, Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer. Oct-15-2019, Richard Boocock, Senior VP, Chief Information Officer & Special Advisor to the Chairman.'}{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alaska Air Group, Inc. Announces Consolidated Operating Results for the Month and Year to Date Ended September 2019', 'text': 'Alaska Air Group, Inc. announced consolidated operating results for the month and year to date ended September 2019. For the month, the company reported revenue passengers of 3,807,000 compared to 3,579,000 a year ago. Revenue passenger miles were 4,452,000,000 compared to 4,186,000,000 a year ago. Available seat miles were 5,365,000,000 compared to 5,183,000,000 a year ago. Passenger load factor was 83.0% compared to 80.8% a year ago. For the year to date, the company reported revenue passengers of 35,018,000 compared to 34,685,000 a year ago. Revenue passenger miles were 42,113,000,000 compared to 41,272,000,000 a year ago. Available seat miles were 50,006,000,000 compared to 49,256,000,000 a year ago. Passenger load factor was 84.2% compared to 83.8% a year ago.'}{'symbol': 'ALB', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Albemarle Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'Albemarle Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ALXN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc. and Stealth BioTherapeutics Corp Announce Agreement for Option to Co-Develop and Commercialize Late-Stage Therapy for Mitochondrial Diseases', 'text': 'Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc. and Stealth BioTherapeutics Corp. announced an agreement for an option to co-develop and commercialize elamipretide for mitochondrial diseases. Currently being evaluated in a Phase 3 study in people with primary mitochondrial myopathy (PMM) - a genetic mitochondrial disease - elamipretide is a novel, potential first-in-class therapy that targets mitochondrial dysfunction. There are currently no therapies approved to treat PMM, which is characterized by debilitating skeletal muscle weakness, chronic fatigue and exercise intolerance. Under the terms of the agreement, Alexion will have the opportunity to exercise the option following the delivery of results from the Phase 3 study currently underway in PMM. Under the terms of the agreement, Alexion will receive an exclusive option to partner with Stealth in the development of subcutaneous elamipretide based on final results from the Phase 3 study currently underway in PMM. If Alexion chooses to exercise the option, the companies will co-develop subcutaneous elamipretide in the U.S. for PMM and Barth syndrome, as well as Leber’s hereditary optic neuropathy (LHON), which is currently in earlier stage clinical development. Upon commercialization, the agreement would provide for a 50-50 co-promote between the two companies in the U.S. and Alexion would receive exclusive rights to develop and commercialize subcutaneous elamipretide outside the U.S.Alexion will make initial payments to Stealth totaling $30 million, including an option fee, an equity investment and development funding. If the option is exercised, the agreement provides for additional payments, including an option exercise fee, an additional equity investment, development funding and potential regulatory and commercial milestone payments. Stealth’s other pipeline assets, including SBT-272, are not included in the option.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Amazon Announces First Fulfillment Center in Idaho', 'text': 'Amazon.com, Inc. announced plans to open its first fulfillment center in Idaho, creating more than 1,000 full-time jobs with comprehensive benefits and opportunities to work alongside Amazon robotics in a workplace. The facility will be located in Nampa, Idaho, and will open in 2020. Amazon will fulfill customer orders such as books, electronics and toys from this 650,000-square-foot fulfillment center. All associates will go through safety training and ongoing coaching and will have access to continuing education opportunities through Amazon’s upskilling programs such as Career Choice. The company will pre-pay up to 95% of tuition for courses related to in-demand fields, regardless of whether the skills are relevant to a career at Amazon. Since the program’s launch, over 25,000 employees have pursued degrees in game design and visual communications, nursing, IT programming and radiology, to name a few.'}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2019-10-10 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Airlines Realigns Its Operations & Commercial Teams', 'text': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES - KERRY PHILIPOVITCH, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE, WILL RETIRE FROM AIRLINE AT END OF 2019.AMERICAN AIRLINES - IS REALIGNING ITS OPERATIONS & COMMERCIAL TEAMS AROUND 4 PILLARS OF THE BUSINESS: OPERATIONS, NETWORK, REVENUE & CUSTOMER.'}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Airlines Group Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'American Airlines Group Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Electric Power Company, Inc. Presents at Wind Energy Finance & Investment Conference, Oct-11-2019 10:30 AM', 'text': 'American Electric Power Company, Inc. Presents at Wind Energy Finance & Investment Conference, Oct-11-2019 10:30 AM. Venue: TimesCenter, New York, United States. Speakers: Joel Jansen, Chief Operating Officer.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Pennsylvania American Water Acquires Steelton Borough Authority Water System', 'text': 'PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER EXPANDS FOOTPRINT WITH ACQUISITION OF STEELTON BOROUGH AUTHORITY WATER SYSTEM.AMERICAN WATER WORKS COMPANY INC -  PURCHASE PRICE FOR SYSTEM WAS $21.75 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ameriprise Financial, Inc. - Analyst/Investor Day', 'text': "To discuss company's business and strategy"}{'symbol': 'AME', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'AMETEK, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'AMETEK, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ANTM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Anthem's Board Names Ryan Schneider as New Director", 'text': "Anthem reported that Ryan Schneider has joined the Board. Schneider is the Chief Executive Officer for Realogy Holdings Corp., a provider of residential real estate franchising and brokerage. Prior to joining Realogy, he served as President for Capital One's Card division, where he was responsible for U.S., U.K., and Canada credit card businesses. He also previously served as a partner at McKinsey and Company focused on its financial services clients."}{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Archer-Daniels-Midland Company, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'Archer-Daniels-Midland Company, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2019-10-10 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Arthur J. Gallagher Acquires Direct To Policyholder (Dtph)', 'text': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ACQUIRES DIRECT TO POLICYHOLDER (DTPH).ARTHUR J GALLAGHER & CO - TERMS OF TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED..'}{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Arthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) acquired Direct To PolicyHolder.', 'text': "Arthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) acquired Direct To PolicyHolder on October 10, 2019. Nick Doyle and his associates will continue to operate from their current location under the direction of Kevin Garvin, head of Gallagher's North American Affinity operations.\nArthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) completed the acquisition of Direct To PolicyHolder on October 10, 2019.\n"}{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PEI Media Group Ltd., Operating Partners Human Capital Forum NY 2019, Oct 17, 2019', 'text': 'PEI Media Group Ltd., Operating Partners Human Capital Forum NY 2019, Oct 17, 2019. Venue: Convene, 117 West 46th Street, New Berlin, New York, United States. To provide insights into the evolving and rapidly changing talent market and share strategies and approaches that uncover why firms need a “human capital operating partner.'}{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Baker Hughes, a GE company Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 12:25 PM', 'text': 'Baker Hughes, a GE company Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 12:25 PM. Venue: Taj Palace, New Delhi, Delhi, India. Speakers: Neil Saunders, President & CEO of Oilfield Equipment.'}{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Steve Menzies and Quadrant Management Inc. completed the acquisition of Applied Underwriters, Inc. from Berkshire Hathaway Inc. (NYSE:BRK.A) and others for an enterprise value of $920 million.', 'text': 'An unknown buyer entered into an agreement to acquire Applied Underwriters, Inc. from Berkshire Hathaway Inc. (NYSE:BRK.A) and others on February 25, 2019. The transaction is subject to regulatory approval and is expected to close in the third quarter\xa0of 2019.\nSteve Menzies and Quadrant Management Inc. completed the acquisition of Applied Underwriters, Inc. from Berkshire Hathaway Inc. (NYSE:BRK.A) and others for an enterprise value of $920 million on October 10, 2019. Under the transaction, Berkshire Hathaway Inc. sold 81% stake in Applied Underwriters, Inc. Quadrant Management Inc. has acquired Applied Underwriters’ service companies as part of the deal.\n'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PEI Media Group Ltd., Capital Structure Forum 2019, Nov 20, 2019 through Nov 21, 2019', 'text': 'PEI Media Group Ltd., Capital Structure Forum 2019, Nov 20, 2019 through Nov 21, 2019. Venue: Glaziers Hall - London, London, United Kingdom.'}{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2019-10-10 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadcom Announces Availability Of BCM6710 Chip', 'text': 'BROADCOM INC - AVAILABILITY OF ITS 3X3 WI-FI 6 CHIP, BCM6710.'}{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadcom Inc. Announces Availability of its 3X3 Wi-Fi 6 Chip', 'text': 'Broadcom Inc. announced the availability of its 3x3 Wi-Fi 6 chip, the BCM6710, designed for WLAN applications including Wi-Fi routers, residential gateways, wireless range extenders, and set-top boxes. The BCM6710 is a highly optimized Wi-Fi 6 chip with integrated RF power amplifiers, providing OEMs a cost-effective, high-performance solution for their mass-market products. The BCM6710 is the first 3x3 Wi-Fi 6 solution supporting three transmit and three receive streams in 2.4-GHz, 5-GHz and future 6-GHz bands. With the 6-GHz Wi-Fi capability, the chip paves the way for high-bandwidth, low-latency applications, such as 4K UHD video streaming, real-time immersive gaming, and augmented reality (AR). BCM6710 Product Highlights: Full compliance to IEEE and WFA 802.11ax specifications; 3 Tx and 3 Rx chains; Selective 2.4-GHz, 5-GHz, or 6-GHz band operation; 1024 QAM modulation; Uplink & downlink OFDMA; MU-MIMO. Availability: Broadcom is now sampling its BCM6710 device to qualified customers.'}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2019-10-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadridge To Expand Fiduciary And Reg Bi Solutions', 'text': 'BROADRIDGE TO EXPAND FIDUCIARY AND REG BI SOLUTIONS FOR WEALTH AND RETIREMENT INDUSTRY WITH ACQUISITION OF FI360.BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS INC - TERMS OF TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED.'}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. (NYSE:BR) entered into an agreement to acquire Fi360, Inc.', 'text': 'Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. (NYSE:BR) entered into an agreement to acquire Fi360, Inc. on October 10, 2019. The transaction is subject to the satisfaction of customary closing conditions, including regulatory approvals, and antitrust approval. As of October 25, 2019, the transaction is approved by Federal Tarde Commission. The transaction is expected to close in November. Raymond James & Associates, Inc. acted as financial advisor to Fi360. Daniel Berick of Squire Patton Boggs (US) LLP acted as legal advisor to Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc.\n'}{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cerner Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'Cerner Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Chevron Corporation Presents at PRSA 2019 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE, Oct-20-2019', 'text': 'Chevron Corporation Presents at PRSA 2019 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE, Oct-20-2019 . Venue: San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Dave Samson, General Manager Public Affairs.'}{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cigna Corporation Announces Early Results of Exchange Offers and Consent Solicitations for Senior Notes', 'text': 'Cigna Corporation announced the early results of its previously announced offers to Eligible Holders to exchange any and all of certain outstanding notes issued by Cigna’s wholly-owned subsidiaries: Cigna Holding Company, a Delaware corporation, Express Scripts Holding Company, a Delaware corporation, and Medco Health Solutions Inc., a Delaware corporation for new senior notes to be issued by Cigna (collectively, the “New Cigna Notes”) and cash, and (2) solicitations of Eligible Holders of each series of Existing Notes to consent to Proposed Amendments to the indentures governing such Existing Notes. Cigna currently expects to elect to have an early settlement (such date, the “Early Settlement Date”) on October 11, 2019. Other than with respect to the 8.30% Notes due 2023 and the 7.65% Notes due 2023, Cigna has received the requisite consents from the holders of the Existing Notes to amend each of the indentures governing the Existing Notes to eliminate certain of the covenants, restrictive provisions, reporting requirements, events of default and related provisions therein (the “Proposed Amendments”), subject to the terms and conditions set forth in the offering memorandum and consent solicitation statement, dated as of September 26, 2019 (the “Offering Memorandum and Consent Solicitation Statement”). On the Early Settlement Date, the applicable Subsidiary Issuer and the applicable trustee for each series of Existing Notes (other than the trustee for the 8.30% Notes due 2023 and the 7.65% Notes due 2023) will enter into supplemental indenture(s) that will give effect to the Proposed Amendments to each series of Existing Notes (other than the 8.30% Notes due 2023 and the 7.65% Notes due 2023) and the Proposed Amendments will become operative. Cigna will accept for exchange all of the 8.30% Notes due 2023 and the 7.65% Notes due 2023 that have been tendered prior to the Early Tender Date in the Exchange Offers on the Early Settlement Date, thereby waiving the condition that the Exchange Offers for these two series of notes are conditioned on the completion of the Consent Solicitations for these two series of notes. Notwithstanding the expected Early Settlement Date on October 11, 2019, Eligible Holders who did not tender at or prior to the Early Tender Date may still tender Existing Notes in the Exchange Offers until to 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on November 4, 2019 (the “Expiration Date”), unless the Exchange Offers are extended or terminated by Cigna. Any tenders after the Early Tender Date may not be withdrawn, unless required by law. As set forth in the Offering Memorandum and Consent Solicitation Statement, for each $1,000 principal amount of Existing Notes tendered after the Early Tender Date and before the Expiration Date, Eligible Holders will receive $970 principal amount of New Cigna Notes and no cash consideration. The New Cigna Notes will be fully and unconditionally guaranteed, jointly and severally, on an unsecured and unsubordinated basis, by each of Cigna Holding Company and Express Scripts Holding Company, subject to a guarantee release condition which will be set forth in the indenture governing the New Cigna Notes (the “Guarantee Release Condition”). The Guarantee Release Condition is expected to be satisfied concurrently with the issuance of the New Cigna Notes on the Early Settlement Date. Cigna expects to enter into a registration rights agreement on the Early Settlement Date, pursuant to which Cigna will agree to use its commercially reasonable efforts to file an exchange offer registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) to allow holders of New Cigna Notes to exchange their New Cigna Notes for the same principal amount of exchange notes of the same series, which will have terms identical in all material respects to such New Cigna Notes, except that the exchange notes will not contain transfer restrictions. The New Cigna Notes have not been registered under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the “Securities Act”) or any state or foreign securities laws. The New Cigna Notes may not be offered or sold in the United States or to any U.S. persons except pursuant to an exemption from, or in a transaction not subject to, the registration requirements of the Securities Act. The Exchange Offers and Consent Solicitations are only being made to persons who certify that they are (a) “Qualified Institutional Buyers”, as such term is defined in Rule 144A under the Securities Act or (b) persons that are outside the United States and that are (i) not “U.S. persons,” as such terms are defined in Rule 902 under the Securities Act and (ii) “non-U.S. qualified offerees”, as such term is defined in the Eligibility Letter (as defined below) (such persons, “Eligible Holders”). As such, documents relating to the Exchange Offers and Consent Solicitations will only be distributed to holders of Existing Notes who complete and return an eligibility letter (the “Eligibility Letter”) confirming that they are Eligible Holders of Existing Notes. In addition, if an Eligible Holder of Existing Notes is a resident of Canada, such Eligible Holder must also certify that it is an “accredited investor,” as such term is defined in the National Instrument 45-106—Prospectus Exemptions or Section 73.3(1) of the Securities Act (Ontario), as applicable, and is a “permitted client,” as such term is defined in National Instrument 31-103—Registration Requirements, Exemptions and Ongoing Registrant Obligations.'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Bloomberg L.P., 3rd Annual Bloomberg CIO Exchange, Oct 16, 2019', 'text': 'Bloomberg L.P., 3rd Annual Bloomberg CIO Exchange, Oct 16, 2019. Venue: Nasdaq MarketSite, New York, United States.'}{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Citigroup Inc. Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-15-2019 11:30 AM', 'text': 'Citigroup Inc. Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-15-2019 11:30 AM. Venue: Current at Pier 59, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Peter Babej, Head of Global FIG.'}{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Citizens Financial Group, Inc. Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 10:45 AM', 'text': 'Citizens Financial Group, Inc. Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 10:45 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: John F. Woods, Vice Chairman & CFO.'}{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'CMS Energy Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'CMS Energy Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Coca-Cola Company Presents at PRSA 2019 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE, Oct-20-2019', 'text': 'The Coca-Cola Company Presents at PRSA 2019 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE, Oct-20-2019 . Venue: San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Kent Landers, Vice President External Communications.'}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Canopy Growth Announces New Chair Of The Board Of Directors', 'text': 'CANOPY GROWTH ANNOUNCES NEW CHAIR OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS.CANOPY GROWTH CORP - DAVID KLEIN HAS BEEN APPOINTED CHAIR OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.CANOPY GROWTH CORP - KLEIN CURRENTLY SERVES AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF CONSTELLATION BRANDS INC.CANOPY GROWTH CORP - INTERIM CHAIR JOHN BELL WILL REMAIN AS A DIRECTOR ON BOARD.'}{'symbol': 'CPRT', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Copart, Inc. Expands Montreal, Quebec Location in Canada', 'text': 'Copart, Inc. announced a 24-acre expansion to its Montreal location in Quebec, Canada. This location is one of seven Copart locations in Canada including: Calgary, Edmonton, Moncton, Halifax, London and Toronto.'}{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Corteva, Inc. Announces Retirement of Neal Gutterson as Senior Vice President and Chief Technology Officer', 'text': 'On October 8, 2019, Mr. Neal Gutterson, Ph.D., Senior Vice President and Chief Technology Officer indicated his intent to retire from Corteva, Inc. in the second half of 2020. He has agreed to remain with the Company until his successor has been selected and for a period of time thereafter to assure a smooth transition. The Company has engaged an executive recruitment firm to identify a replacement.'}{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2019-10-10 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Corteva Sets Quarterly Dividend Of $0.13Per Share', 'text': 'SETS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.13PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Costco Reports Net Sales Of $14.41 Bln For Retail Month Of Sept', 'text': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS SEPTEMBER SALES RESULTS.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - NET SALES OF $14.41 BILLION FOR RETAIL MONTH OF SEPTEMBER.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES FOR 5 WEEKS ENDED OCT 6 WAS UP 5.0% FOR U.S..COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES EXCLUDING IMPACTS FROM CHANGES IN GASOLINE PRICES AND FOREIGN EXCHANGE WAS UP 5.6% FOR SEPT.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES FOR 5 WEEKS ENDED OCT 6 WAS UP 4.2% .'}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2019-10-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Costco Wholesale Says Comparable Sales For 5 Weeks Ended Oct 6 Was Up 4.7%', 'text': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS SEPTEMBER SALES RESULTS.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - NET SALES OF $14.41 BILLION FOR RETAIL MONTH OF SEPTEMBER.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES FOR 5 WEEKS ENDED OCT 6 WAS UP 5.0% FOR U.S..COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES FOR 5 WEEKS ENDED OCT 6 WAS UP 4.7%.COSTCO WHOLESALE CORP - COMPARABLE SALES EXCLUDING IMPACTS FROM CHANGES IN GASOLINE PRICES AND FOREIGN EXCHANGE WAS UP 5.6% FOR SEPT.'}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2019-10-10 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Costco Wholesale - Confirms Has Acted Appropriately Relative To Children's Sleepers Referenced In Media", 'text': "COSTCO WHOLESALE - CONFIRMS HAS ACTED APPROPRIATELY RELATIVE TO CHILDREN'S SLEEPERS THAT HAVE BEEN REFERENCED IN MEDIA.COSTCO WHOLESALE  - COSTCO'S SUPPLIER ALSO SOURCED SLEEPERS FROM FACTORY IN XINJIANG, BUT CO HAS NOT RECEIVED ANY OF THOSE SLEEPERS.COSTCO WHOLESALE - FACTORY IN XINJIANG WAS SUBJECT OF FAVORABLE AUDITS THAT SHOWED ABSENCE OF FORCED LABOR AND OTHER FAVORABLE RESULTS.COSTCO WHOLESALE - SUSPENDED SALES OF CHILDREN'S SLEEPERS PENDING FURTHER INVESTIGATION AND DEVELOPMENTS.COSTCO - FACTORIES OUTSIDE XINJIANG WHERE SLEEPERS WERE SOURCED ARE NOT CONNECTED TO ENTITY RECENTLY NAMED AS SUBJECT OF A DETENTION ORDER."}{'symbol': 'DHI', 'date': '2019-10-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'D.R. Horton Inc Enters Into An Underwriting Agreement', 'text': 'D.R. HORTON INC - ENTERED INTO AN UNDERWRITING AGREEMENT.D.R. HORTON - TO OFFER AND SALE IN PUBLIC OFFERING OF $500 MILLION OF 2.500% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2024.'}{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Delta Air Lines, Inc. Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on November 14, 2019', 'text': "The Board of Directors of Delta Air Lines, Inc. has declared Delta's 26th consecutive quarterly dividend. The dividend of $0.4025 per share will be payable to shareholders of record as of the close of business on October 24, 2019, to be paid on November 14, 2019."}{'symbol': 'DPZ', 'date': '2019-10-10 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Capital World Investors Reports 10.8% Passive Stake In Domino's Pizza", 'text': "CAPITAL WORLD INVESTORS REPORTS 10.8% PASSIVE STAKE IN DOMINO'S PIZZA INC AS OF SEPTEMBER 30 - SEC FILING."}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2019-10-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dover Corp Says On Oct 4, Co Entered Into A $1 Billion Five-Year Unsecured Revolving Credit Facility', 'text': "DOVER CORP -  ON OCT 4, CO ENTERED INTO A $1 BILLION FIVE-YEAR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY WITH A SYNDICATE OF THIRTEEN BANKS.DOVER - COMMITMENTS OF LENDERS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENT MAY BE INCREASED BY ADDITIONAL AMOUNT OF UP TO $500 MILLION DURING TERM OF CREDIT AGREEMENT.DOVER - CREDIT AGREEMENT REPLACES EXISTING $1 BILLION FIVE-YEAR UNSECURED CREDIT FACILITY PURSUANT TO A CREDIT AGREEMENT DATED NOVEMBER 10, 2015.DOVER CORP - LENDERS' COMMITMENTS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENT WILL TERMINATE ON OCT 4, 2024."}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dow Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on December 13, 2019', 'text': 'Dow declared a dividend of 70 cents per share, payable December 13, 2019, to shareholders of record on November 29, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dupont Declares Regular Quarterly Dividend on Common Stock, Payable on December 13, 2019', 'text': "DuPont's board of directors declared a fourth quarter dividend of $0.30 per share on the outstanding common stock of the company payable on December 13, 2019, to holders of record of said stock at the close of business on November 29, 2019."}{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Edwards Lifesciences Corporation Invests $100 Million to Expand Its Operations in Costa Rica', 'text': 'Edwards Lifesciences Corporation expanded its presence in Costa Rica with a $100 million investment and the addition of 500 new jobs by the end of 2020. The brand new facility is located in La Lima Industrial Park in Cartago and has an extension of 274,000 square feet. This new building joins the existing one within the same industrial park to collectively expand the capability to produce finished products, in addition to the processes that has been on operation since 2017.'}{'symbol': 'ENPH', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Enphase Energy, Inc. Announces Venture Solar Leveraging the Simplicity of Enphase Home Energy Management Products to Expand its Service Territory into Connecticut and Massachusetts', 'text': 'Enphase Energy, Inc. announced that Venture Solar, an award-winning residential solar installation company based in New York, NY, is leveraging the simplicity of Enphase home energy management products to expand its service territory into Connecticut and Massachusetts. Venture Solar has optimized the technical and equipment aspects of its residential solar installation business by leveraging the plug-and-play simplicity of the Enphase IQ™ home energy platform. Enphase IQ microinverters, a key component of the platform, dramatically simplify solar installations as a complete AC system that ensures that neither installers nor homeowners are exposed to high-voltage DC, providing a safe solar solution for homeowners. Venture Solar uses Enphase IQ microinverters as well as the full suite of Enphase IQ accessory products: the lighter two-wire Enphase Q Cable wire system, the Enphase IQ Combiner 3 device with pre-installed Enphase IQ Envoy communications gateway, all of which help make solar installation simple and fast.'}{'symbol': 'EVRG', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'West Plains and Evergy, Inc. Announce Solar Energy Agreement', 'text': 'The City of West Plains, Mo., will partner with Evergy, Inc. to provide solar power to the community. Evergy will build a new solar array in West Plains that will generate 9.6 megawatts of energy, enough to power 1,200 homes.'}{'symbol': 'RE', 'date': '2019-10-10 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Travel24.com Says Vicus Group Buys All Shares In RE Beteiligungsgesellschaft', 'text': 'VICUS GROUP AG HAS ACQUIRED ALL SHARES IN RE BETEILIGUNGSGESELLSCHAFT MBH.MANAGEMENT WAS TAKEN OVER BY MICHAEL KLEMMER, CEO OF VICUS GROUP AG AND MEMBER OF THE SUPERVISORY BOARD OF TRAVEL24.COM AG.RE BETEILIGUNGSGESELLSCHAFT MBH HOLDS 12.02% OF THE VOTING RIGHTS IN TRAVEL24.COM AG.VICUS GROUP AG OWNS 19.18% OF THE VOTING RIGHTS IN TRAVEL24.COM.VICUS GROUP AG HAS GAINED CONTROL OF TRAVEL24.COM AG WITHIN THE MEANING OF SECTION 29 WPÜG.'}{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'S&P Global Platts Inc., 12th Annual Nodal Trader Conference, Oct 24, 2019 through Oct 25, 2019', 'text': 'S&P Global Platts Inc., 12th Annual Nodal Trader Conference, Oct 24, 2019 through Oct 25, 2019. Venue: Crowne Plaza Times Square, 1605 Broadway, New  York, New York, United States.'}{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ExxonMobil Upstream Oil and Gas Company Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 11:30 AM', 'text': 'ExxonMobil Upstream Oil and Gas Company Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 11:30 AM. Venue: Taj Palace, New Delhi, Delhi, India. Speakers: Peter Clarke, Head of Global LNG, Senior Vice President.'}{'symbol': 'FAST', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Fastenal Company Announces Cash Dividend, Payable on November 22, 2019', 'text': 'Fastenal Company reported that its board of directors declared a dividend of $0.22 per share to be paid in cash on November 22, 2019 to shareholders of record at the close of business on October 25, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'First Republic Bank Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 09:40 AM', 'text': 'First Republic Bank Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 09:40 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: Michael D. Selfridge, Chief Banking Officer & Senior EVP, Olga Tsokova, Senior VP & Chief Accounting Officer.'}{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ford Motor Company Declares Fourth Quarter Regular Dividend on Class B and Common Stock, Payable on Dec. 2, 2019', 'text': 'The Board of Directors of Ford Motor Company declared a fourth quarter regular dividend of $0.15 per share on the company’s outstanding Class B and common stock. The fourth quarter dividend is payable on Dec. 2, 2019, to shareholders of record at the close of business on Oct. 22, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Gardner Denver Announces Emily Weaver As Chief Financial Officer', 'text': 'GARDNER DENVER ANNOUNCES EMILY A. WEAVER AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - WEAVER JOINS GARDNER DENVER FROM FORTIVE CORPORATION WHERE SHE IS CURRENTLY ITS CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC -  APPOINTMENT OF EMILY A. WEAVER AS CFO EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - WEAVER WILL SUCCEED NEIL SNYDER AS CFO.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - CFO NEIL SNYDER IS LEAVING TO PURSUE OTHER OPPORTUNITIES.'}{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Rubicon Minerals Corporation announced that it has received CAD 12 million in funding from Franklin Resources, Inc. and other investors', 'text': 'On October 10, 2019, Rubicon Minerals Corporation (TSX:RMX) closed the transaction. The company issued 12,000,000 shares for gross proceeds of CAD 12,000,000. The transaction included participation from returning investor Franklin Resources, Inc. (NYSE:BEN) for CAD 1,800,000 and other investors. Franklin Resources, Inc. (NYSE:BEN) invested through its two funds. The company received CAD 2,525,656.04 from 3 investors pursuant to Regulation D.'}{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Fitch Says Automotive Bankruptcies Remain Rare', 'text': 'Oct 10  - General Motors Co <GM.N>::FITCH SAYS HEALTHY PASSENGER VEHICLE SALES, SECTOR PROFITABILITY HAVE RESULTED IN FEW RECENT BANKRUPTCIES & LACK OF DISTRESS IN U.S. AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY.FITCH SAYS WOULD NOT BE SURPRISING TO SEE SMALLER SUPPLIERS BECOME LIQUIDITY CONSTRAINED IF ON-GOING UAW STRIKE AT GENERAL MOTORS DRAGS ON.'}{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Gilead Sciences, Inc. and Galapagos NV Announce Efficacy and Safety Results of Filgotinib Through 52 Weeks in Finch 1 and Finch 3 Studies in Rheumatoid Arthritis', 'text': 'Gilead Sciences, Inc. and Galapagos NV announced that Week 52 data from the registrational Phase 3 FINCH 1 and FINCH 3 trials of filgotinib, an investigational, oral, selective JAK1 inhibitor, for the treatment of moderately-to-severely active rheumatoid arthritis (RA) are consistent with and support the efficacy, safety and tolerability profiles demonstrated in the Week 12 and 24 analyses presented earlier this year. The FINCH Phase 3 program investigated the efficacy and safety of 100 mg and 200 mg filgotinib once daily, in RA patient populations ranging from early stage to biologic-experienced patients. FINCH 1 was a 52-week, randomized, placebo- and adalimumab-controlled trial in combination with methotrexate (MTX) enrolling 1,759 adult patients with moderately to severely active RA who had inadequate response to MTX. The primary endpoint was ACR20 at week 12. The trial included radiographic assessment at weeks 24 and 52. FINCH 3 was a 52-week, randomized trial in 1,252 MTX-naïve patients to evaluate filgotinib 200mg alone and filgotinib 100 mg or 200 mg combined with methotrexate versus methotrexate alone in methotrexate-naïve patients. The primary endpoint was ACR20 at week 24. Radiographic progression was also assessed.'}{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-15-2019 10:30 AM', 'text': 'The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-15-2019 10:30 AM. Venue: Current at Pier 59, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Patrick Fels, Co-Head Insurance Americas.'}{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Halliburton Company Presents at Kuwait Oil & Gas Show and Conference, Oct-13-2019 through Oct-16-2019', 'text': 'Halliburton Company Presents at Kuwait Oil & Gas Show and Conference, Oct-13-2019 through Oct-16-2019. Venue: Kuwait International Fair, Kuwait City, Kuwait. Presentation Date & Speakers: Oct-14-2019, Satyam Priyadarshy, Technology Fellow and Chief Data Scientist. Oct-16-2019, Sarah Hayati, Wireline and Perforating Field Engineer.'}{'symbol': 'HOLX', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hologic, Inc., Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 06, 2019', 'text': 'Hologic, Inc., Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 06, 2019'}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hormel Foods Corporation Updates Earnings Guidance for the Fiscal Year 2019', 'text': 'Hormel Foods Corporation updated earnings guidance for the fiscal year 2019. For the year, the company updated its fiscal 2019 earnings guidance to $1.76 - $1.80 per share from $1.71 - $1.85 per share.'}{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2019-10-10 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Humana Expands Partnership With Accolade', 'text': 'HUMANA EXPANDS PARTNERSHIP WITH ACCOLADE.ACCOLADE - ANNOUNCED AN EXPANSION OF EXISTING PARTNERSHIP WITH HUMANA THAT INCLUDES A $20 MILLION STRATEGIC INVESTMENT FROM HUMANA.ACCOLADE -  HUMANA AND ACCOLADE WILL ALSO "SIGNIFICANTLY EXPAND" GEOGRAPHIES IN 2020.'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'IDXX', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IDEXX Laboratories, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'IDEXX Laboratories, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2019-10-10 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IHS Markit Acquires Novation Analytics', 'text': 'IHS MARKIT ACQUIRES NOVATION ANALYTICS.IHS MARKIT - ACQUIRES NOVATION ANALYTICS, A SPECIALIST PROVIDER OF SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, DATA ANALYSIS & ADVISORY SERVICES TO AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY.'}{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IHS Markit Ltd. Presents at Africa Com 2019, Nov-13-2019 02:40 PM', 'text': 'IHS Markit Ltd. Presents at Africa Com 2019, Nov-13-2019 02:40 PM. Venue: Cape Town, South Africa. Speakers: Bashir Ali, Research Analyst, Service Providers & Platforms.'}{'symbol': 'IR', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Gardner Denver Announces Emily Weaver As Chief Financial Officer', 'text': 'GARDNER DENVER ANNOUNCES EMILY A. WEAVER AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - WEAVER JOINS GARDNER DENVER FROM FORTIVE CORPORATION WHERE SHE IS CURRENTLY ITS CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC -  APPOINTMENT OF EMILY A. WEAVER AS CFO EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - WEAVER WILL SUCCEED NEIL SNYDER AS CFO.GARDNER DENVER HOLDINGS INC - CFO NEIL SNYDER IS LEAVING TO PURSUE OTHER OPPORTUNITIES.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Intel Corporation Presents at Africa Com 2019, Nov-12-2019 through Nov-14-2019', 'text': 'Intel Corporation Presents at Africa Com 2019, Nov-12-2019 through Nov-14-2019. Venue: Cape Town, South Africa. Presentation Date & Speakers: Nov-12-2019, Ofer Lior, Business Development Manager, EMEA, Data Center Management. Nov-13-2019, Dror Shenkar, Senior Solution Architect.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IBM Automation Services Presents at 2019 Private Equity International Operating Partners Forum, Oct-17-2019 10:20 AM', 'text': 'IBM Automation Services Presents at 2019 Private Equity International Operating Partners Forum, Oct-17-2019 10:20 AM. Venue: Convene, 117 West 46th Street, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Gene Chao, General Manager & Global Innovation Unit Executive.'}{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Invesco Ltd., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 23, 2019', 'text': 'Invesco Ltd., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 23, 2019'}{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2019-10-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Invesco Says Preliminary Average Total AUM For Quarter Through Sept. 30 Were $1,188.2 Bln', 'text': 'INVESCO LTD. ANNOUNCES SEPTEMBER 30, 2019 ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT.INVESCO LTD - PRELIMINARY MONTH-END ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT (AUM) OF $1,184.4 BILLION.INVESCO LTD - PRELIMINARY AVERAGE TOTAL AUM FOR QUARTER THROUGH SEPTEMBER 30 WERE $1,188.2 BILLION.INVESCO LTD - PRELIMINARY AVERAGE ACTIVE AUM FOR QUARTER THROUGH SEPTEMBER 30 WERE $915.6 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'San Miguel Corporation Selects Jacobs as Program Management Consultant for the New Manila International Airport Project in Bulacan', 'text': "Jacobs has announced San Miguel Corporation (SMC) has selected it as program management consultant for the New Manila International Airport (NMIA) project in Bulacan, the Philippines. One of the larger and most ambitious infrastructure projects in the country, the entire development includes construction of a new terminal, four runways and airport support facilities spread out over almost 6,200 acres (2,500 hectares) in the province of Bulacan. When complete, the airport will accommodate up to 100 million passengers per year and will significantly ease passenger and air traffic congestion at Manila's existing Ninoy Aquino International Airport. SMC is investing approximately USD 14 billion (PHP 734 billion) into the project with the first phase to be operational within six years. Program management services to be delivered by Jacobs during planning, design and construction phases include project scoping and management, contract development, strategic advisory, design management and scheduling and financial planning."}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Johnson's Baby Powder Was Not The Cause Of California Plaintiff's Disease, says J&J Spokesman", 'text': 'Oct 10  - Johnson & Johnson <JNJ.N>::JOHNSON’S BABY POWDER DOES NOT CONTAIN ASBESTOS AND WAS NOT THE CAUSE OF CALIFORNIA PLAINTIFF’S DISEASE - J&J SPOKESMAN.J&J SPOKESMAN ON VERDICT OF CALIFORNIA JURY IN TALC CANCER RETRIAL SAYS "THIS IS THE SEVENTH JURY THAT HAS FOUND IN FAVOR OF JOHNSON & JOHNSON".'}{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'JPMorgan Chase & Co. Presents at Wind Energy Finance & Investment Conference, Oct-10-2019 04:30 PM', 'text': 'JPMorgan Chase & Co. Presents at Wind Energy Finance & Investment Conference, Oct-10-2019 04:30 PM. Venue: TimesCenter, New York, United States. Speakers: Mit Buchanan, Managing Director, Energy Investments.'}{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'KeyCorp Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 01:05 PM', 'text': 'KeyCorp Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 01:05 PM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: Christopher Marrott Gorman, President of Banking, President, COO & Director, Donald R. Kimble, Vice Chairman & CFO.'}{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Kinder Morgan, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 16, 2019', 'text': 'Kinder Morgan, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 16, 2019'}{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Kraft Heinz Company, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'The Kraft Heinz Company, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Leidos to Provide National Institutes of Health Software Development Support Services', 'text': "Leidos has been awarded a follow-on contract by the Eunice Kennedy Shriver National Institute of Child Health and Human Development (NICHD) within the National Institutes of Health (NIH) to provide a wide range of software development services in support of the Office of Extramural Research (OER). The single award, cost-plus-fixed-fee contract has a one-year base period of performance followed by four one-year option periods, and an approximate value of $150 million, if all options are exercised. Work will be performed in Bethesda, MD. The OER provides vital solutions to manage the receipt, processing, review, award reporting and monitoring of more than $30 billion in research and non-research grants awarded annually to improve human health through biomedical research and public health services. OER systems are used by applicants and grantees at more than 38,000 institutions worldwide. Under the contract, Leidos will provide software development services including design, development, and application testing services following the eRA Agile software development lifecycle. Leidos' use of automation and artificial intelligence (AI) will continue to increase efficiency and drive down maintenance costs for OER."}{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Two New Annuities Add to Lincoln Financial Group’s Growing Portfolio for Registered Investment Advisors', 'text': 'Lincoln Financial Group announced it has introduced two new products for registered investment advisors (RIAs): a commission-free, single premium immediate annuity (SPIA), Lincoln Insured IncomeSMAdvisoryand a commission-free deferred income annuity, Lincoln Deferred Income SolutionsSMAdvisory. These newsolutions will help fee-only advisors provide options for clients seeking protected lifetime income in retirement to help cover their expenses, and add to the breadth of Lincoln’s portfolio of solutions available for RIAs. By providing protected lifetime income, SPIAs and DIAs defend against both longevity and market risk in retirement. Consistent income continues irrespective of market performance. Income annuities can generally provide a higher income payout than other available options, and can be a great way to help solve for given retirement expenses, leaving more portfolio assets for discretionary spending and legacy goals.'}{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'LKQ Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019', 'text': 'LKQ Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'M&T Bank Corporation Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 10:00 AM', 'text': 'M&T Bank Corporation Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 10:00 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Medtronic plc (NYSE:MDT) acquired AV-Medical from private American investor, Michael Tal and employees.', 'text': 'Medtronic plc (NYSE:MDT) acquired AV-Medical from private American investor, Michael Tal and employees on October 10, 2019.\nMedtronic plc (NYSE:MDT) completed the acquisition of AV-Medical from private American investor, Michael Tal and employees on October 10, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'MCHP', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Microchip Technology Inc. Unveils Adaptec Smart Storage Open Source Tools', 'text': 'Microchip Technology Inc. announced that public and private cloud infrastructure suppliers are turning to open source tools to simplify the configuration, deployment and management of their server storage platforms. Until now, companies were faced with the challenge of creating their own tools to manage their storage adapters and embedded solutions for these platforms. The company is the first to address this need by offering production-ready open source tools for managing its Adaptec Smart Storage HBA, SmartHBA and SmartRAID offerings in OpenStack data centers. By investing in and offering readily deployable open source tools and plug-ins, Microchip removes complexity for customers that are connecting storage resources to its Adaptec lineup of storage controller solutions in heterogeneous data centers powered by OpenStack. The prequalified and tested Adaptec Smart Storage tools are scalable and customizable, simplifying management of large networks of cloud servers within enterprise-class infrastructures. The Adaptec Smart Storage OpenStack tools include three components: 1) a plug-in for Metal as a Service (MaaS), a bare-metal deployment tool from cloud industry leader and Ubuntu creator Canonical Ltd.; 2) a scripted service formula, or "charm", created with Canonical\'s Juju modelling tool that allows users to remotely deploy Adaptec ARCCONF in any type of cloud environment so the adapters and attached devices can be configured and managed remotely using the Juju dashboard; and 3) a plug-in for the OpenStack Horizon Graphical User Interface (GUI) that allows users to discover, configure and conveniently manage both Adaptec Smart Storage standard adapters and custom embedded solutions.'}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Atea Announces Strategic Partnership with Microsoft in Nordics Within Cloud Services', 'text': 'Atea announced strategic partnership with Microsoft in Nordics within cloud services. Nordic customers are now demanding hybrid cloud solutions to scale their operations. This is a rapidly growing market trend in all of the Nordic countries, and there is a severe shortage of specialist competence in this area. Atea has committed itself to address this shortage by placing several hundred consultants through a cloud services training program in collaboration with Microsoft. When Microsoft opens two new Azure data centers in Norway this fall, Atea will be their first strategic partner to provide cloud services in the Nordics. The agreement which has been signed with Microsoft is one of the first of its kind globally. In total, the agreement covers the practical and economic aspects of a business collaboration with Microsoft, an extensive training plan, and in addition secures Atea with access to global Azure specialists. The agreement has a three-year term.'}{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mondelez International, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 29, 2019', 'text': 'Mondelez International, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 29, 2019'}{'symbol': 'MNST', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Monster Beverage Corporation (NasdaqGS:MNST) acquired plant in Athy from Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NasdaqGS:COKE).', 'text': 'Monster Beverage Corporation (NasdaqGS:MNST) acquired plant in Athy from Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NasdaqGS:COKE) on October 10, 2019.\nMonster Beverage Corporation (NasdaqGS:MNST) completed the acquisition of plant in Athy from Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NasdaqGS:COKE) on October 10, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2019-10-10 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mosaic Announces Temporary Curtailment At Its Esterhazy Potash Mine', 'text': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES TEMPORARY CURTAILMENT AT ITS ESTERHAZY POTASH MINE.MOSAIC CO - CURTAILMENT IS NOT EXPECTED TO IMPACT PACE OF DEVELOPMENT AT ESTERHAZY MINE K3 PROJECT.MOSAIC CO - CURTAILMENT BRINGS ANNOUNCED POTASH CURTAILMENTS TO UP TO 600,000 TONNES.MOSAIC - NEAR-TERM FERTILIZER MARKETS REMAIN CHALLENGING.MOSAIC - CONTINUE TO EXPECT A VERY STRONG APPLICATION SEASON IN BRAZIL AND NORTH AMERICA, AND A BETTER SUPPLY AND DEMAND BALANCE IN 2020.MOSAIC - IF FULL AMOUNT OF CURTAILMENT IS REALIZED IN LOWER Q4 2019 SALES, IT WOULD RESULT IN NEGATIVE IMPACT OF ABOUT $150 MILLION IN ADJUSTED EBITDA.MOSAIC CO - INCREASED CURTAILMENT IS BASED ON INCREASING INVENTORIES AS A RESULT OF A SHORT-TERM SLOWDOWN IN GLOBAL POTASH MARKETS.MOSAIC CO - INCREASED CURTAILMENT IS DUE TO INCREASED RISKS OF A DELAY IN CHINESE CONTRACT SETTLEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Mosaic Company Announces Temporary Curtailment at Its Esterhazy Potash Mine', 'text': 'The Mosaic Company announced that it will temporarily curtail production at its Esterhazy mine, which when combined with a previously announced potash curtailment, brings total curtailments to up to 600,000 tonnes. The curtailment is not expected to impact the pace of development at the Esterhazy mine K3 project. The increased curtailment is based on increasing inventories as a result of a short-term slowdown in global potash markets and increased risks of a delay in Chinese contract settlement. If the full amount of the curtailment is realized in lower fourth quarter 2019 sales, it would result in a negative impact of approximately $150 million in adjusted EBITDA.'}{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'NiSource Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019', 'text': 'NiSource Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019'}{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Symantec Corporation, Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'Symantec Corporation, Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Occidental Petroleum Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019', 'text': 'Occidental Petroleum Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019'}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Omnicom Group Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 15, 2019', 'text': 'Omnicom Group Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 15, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Oracle Opens Retail Innovation and Technology Center in Portugal', 'text': 'Oracle Retail unveiled a new Innovation and Technology Center in Porto. The center will focus initially on delivering breakthrough retail innovations leveraging the latest technologies, including artificial intelligence and machine learning. The technology team, including many developers, will be dedicated to creating bespoke integrations and enhancements to the Oracle Retail portfolio and re-usable assets that deliver increased value to customers. In the past year, Oracle has logged roughly 13,000 person-days of development, focused on continuous innovation with Micro-Apps that integrate with the base code of the Oracle Retail portfolio. The Oracle Innovation and Technology Center is located in the Centro Empresarial Lionesa Business Resort, near the beautiful River Leça and the Leça do Balio Monastery, which is convenient for the airport, main highways, and trains. Oracle will continue to draw talent from nearby Universities specializing in Business and Information Technology from the surrounding areas.'}{'symbol': 'PAYC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Paycom Software, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 29, 2019', 'text': 'Paycom Software, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 29, 2019'}{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PepsiCo, Inc. and Hollywood Park Partnering in an Expansive Agreement', 'text': "PepsiCo and Hollywood Park announced that they are partnering in an expansive agreement that makes Pepsi and Frito-Lay the exclusive soft drink and salty snacks partners across SoFi Stadium and Hollywood Park, a move that further deepens PepsiCo's affiliation with sports and entertainment in California. The partnership, which extends across the Los Angeles Chargers and Los Angeles Rams, will put PepsiCo front and center of the highly anticipated destination in Inglewood, where it will serve its signature brands to millions of fans across all events."}{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Philip Morris International Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 17, 2019', 'text': 'Philip Morris International Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 17, 2019'}{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The PNC Financial Services Group, Inc. Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 08:55 AM', 'text': 'The PNC Financial Services Group, Inc. Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 08:55 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: Gagan Singh, Chief Investment Officer, Robert Q. Reilly, Executive VP & CFO.'}{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Prudential Financial, Inc. (NYSE:PRU) completed the acquisition of Assurance IQ, Inc.', 'text': 'Prudential Financial, Inc. (NYSE:PRU) entered into an agreement to acquire Assurance IQ, Inc. for $3.5 billion on September 4, 2019. The consideration to be paid at closing is $1.88 billion in cash and $470 million in restricted common stock and equity awards of Prudential Financial, Inc. A portion of the cash consideration is expected to settle in equity awards of Prudential Financial, Inc. In addition, subject to the terms and conditions in the agreement, up to $1.15 billion in a mix of cash and common stock of Prudential Financial, Inc. will be payable in 2023 contingent upon Assurance IQ, Inc.’s achievement of certain targets for gross revenues net of associated selling expenses over the period from January 1, 2020 through December 31, 2022. Holder of each vested Phantom share award that is issued and outstanding as of immediately prior to the effective time will receive cash in an amount equal to the excess of the per share cash merger consideration over the Phantom exercise price, plus the per share stock merger consideration while unvested Phantom share awards will be granted restricted units of Prudential Financial, Inc. At the effective time, with respect to each outstanding option, whether vested or unvested, such option shall be deemed to be a rollover option unless, with respect to any vested option, the holder thereof elects to receive the per share closing merger and satisfies the cash-out option conditions not less than 5 business days prior to the closing date. Each cash-out option will be given cash in an amount equal to the excess of the per share cash merger consideration over the exercise price, and the per share stock merger consideration which per share stock merger consideration. Each rollover option that is issued and outstanding as of immediately prior to the effective time shall automatically be canceled and converted into a non-qualified option granted under Prudential Financial, Inc.’s 2016 Omnibus Incentive Plan.\n\nThe cash portion of the merger consideration is expected to be paid with a combination of available cash of $1.2 billion and additional debt financing of $0.68 billion. Upon completion, Assurance IQ, Inc. will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Prudential Financial, Inc. under the U.S. Businesses division. The agreement provides for certain termination rights of Prudential Financial, Inc. and Assurance IQ, Inc., including termination by Prudential Financial, Inc. or Assurance IQ, Inc. if the transaction has not been consummated on or before February 1, 2020. Assurance IQ, Inc.’s co-founders Michael Rowell and Michael Paulus will continue with Michael Rowell remaining as the Chief Executive Officer and reporting to Andrew Sullivan, who will assume the role of Executive Vice President and head of U.S. Businesses as of December 1, 2019. Michael Paulus will remain President of Assurance IQ, Inc.\n\nThe transaction is subject to customary closing conditions, including government approvals, shareholder approvals, the expiration or termination of the applicable waiting periods under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act of 1976, as amended, certain key employees not having revoked or terminated their applicable employment agreement, restrictive covenant agreement and liquidation proceeds agreement and not having terminated their employment with Assurance IQ, Inc. and completion of pre-closing restructuring. The transaction was unanimously approved by Prudential Financial, Inc.’s Board of Directors. The Board of Director of Assurance IQ, Inc. also approved the transaction. As on September 27, 2019, the transaction received early termination notice from Federal Trade Commission. The Boards of Prudential Financial, Inc. and Assurance IQ, Inc. have recommended the approval of the transaction by their respective shareholders. The transaction is expected to occur early in the fourth quarter of 2019. The acquisition is expected to be modestly accretive to EPS and ROE starting in 2020. J.P. Morgan Securities LLC acted as financial advisor for Prudential Financial, Inc. Andrew Bab, David Grosgold, Eric Juergens, Henry Lebowitz, Peter J. Loughran, Paul Rubin, Ramya Tiller, Gary Friedman, Franklin Mitchell, Peter Schuur, Lawrence Cagney, Elizabeth Pagel Serebransky, Luke Dembosky, Ted Hassi, Michael Devins, Jacob Stahl, John M. Vasily and Jennifer L. Chu of Debevoise & Plimpton LLP acted as legal advisors for Prudential Financial, Inc. Nicholas G. Demmo of Wachtell, Lipton, Rosen & Katz acted as legal advisor for Assurance IQ, Inc. FTP Securities LLC served as exclusive strategic and financial advisor to Assurance and its board of directors.\nPrudential Financial, Inc. (NYSE:PRU) completed the acquisition of Assurance IQ, Inc. on October 10, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'PSA', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Public Storage, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019', 'text': 'Public Storage, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019'}{'symbol': 'RL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ralph Lauren Corporation, Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'Ralph Lauren Corporation, Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019', 'text': 'Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019'}{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Regions Financial Corporation Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 11:25 AM', 'text': 'Regions Financial Corporation Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-07-2019 11:25 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States.'}{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Esprit Selects Salesforce to Enhance Its Digital Strategy for Retailers and Consumers', 'text': "Salesforce announced that international fashion brand Esprit has selected Salesforce to enhance its digital strategy for retailers and consumers. The company is bringing its ecommerce and marketing on a single platform, powered by artificial intelligence (AI), to transform shopping journeys and deliver connected, intelligent and personalized shopping experiences.Esprit is deploying Salesforce Commerce Cloud, Marketing Cloud and Einstein to create AI-powered ecommerce and marketing journeys that seamlessly connect across mobile, social, web and more. Both retailers and consumers will enjoy smarter, more personalized omnichannel shopping experiences, with predictive product recommendations and offers tailored to their individual needs. In addition, retailers will get the B2B-specific functionality they need for larger, more complex purchases—for example, an order of merchandise to stock multiple stores for an entire season, and shipping for multiple delivery dates and locations. To accelerate its digital transformation, Esprit has partnered with Salesforce Success Cloud advisory services. Success Cloud's team of experts will work closely with Esprit on the company's digital strategy and implementation to achieve results faster."}{'symbol': 'SLB', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Schlumberger Limited Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 12:25 PM', 'text': 'Schlumberger Limited Presents at 2019 India Energy Forum, Oct-14-2019 12:25 PM. Venue: Taj Palace, New Delhi, Delhi, India. Speakers: Ashok Belani, Executive Vice President of Technology.'}{'symbol': 'SEE', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sealed Air Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 06, 2019', 'text': 'Sealed Air Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 06, 2019'}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'State Street Corporation Launches Direct Access Lending', 'text': 'State Street Corporation announced the launch of Direct Access Lending, a securities finance product that enables direct, principal loans between its lending clients and its borrowing clients. The new managed peer-to-peer product will leverage the size and strength of State Street’s Agency Lending and Enhanced Custody programs, and underscores a continued focus on aligning solutions and technology across State Street to help clients achieve their objectives. To facilitate the direct lending transactions, State Street will leverage both its Agency Lending and Enhanced Custody programs to offer both sets of customers the benefits of each program required to operate in a peer-to-peer transaction while also enjoying an economic benefit associated with Direct Access loans. The product offers a seamless peer-to-peer model, supported by the operational efficiency and expertise of a managed securities lending program.'}{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'SVB Financial Group, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'SVB Financial Group, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Synopsys, Inc. Announces GLOBALFOUNDRIES Qualifies Synopsys Fusion Design Platform on 12LP FinFET Platform', 'text': "Synopsys, Inc. announced that GLOBALFOUNDRIES® (GF®) has qualified Synopsys' Fusion Design Platform™ for its 12-nanometer (nm) Leading-Performance (12LP) FinFET platform. Optimized for the high-performance and low-power requirements of artificial intelligence (AI), cloud computing, and mobile system-on-chips (SoCs), the production-ready flow is based on the silicon-proven RTL-to-GDSII 12LP foundry reference flow and incorporates Synopsys Advanced Fusion technologies for best quality-of-results (QoR) and time-to-results (TTR) in FinFET designs. The Synopsys Fusion Design Platform optimized for GF's 12LP FinFET platform utilized the latest enhancements in the digital implementation and signoff flow to maximize GF's 12LP performance and power benefits. Advanced RC modeling and pin access optimization in Design Compiler® Graphical and Design Compiler NXT synthesis solutions enable tighter correlation with IC Compiler™ II place-and-route, leading to faster design convergence. Logic restructuring, a key feature of Advanced Fusion Technology, enables fast area, timing, power, or congestion-based re-synthesis. ECO Fusion reduces the need for excessive engineering change order (ECO) iterations by allowing rapid design changes during the physical implementation, resulting in faster timing convergence. The key tools and technologies of the Synopsys Fusion Design Platform certified for GF's 12LP FinFET platform include: IC Compiler II place-and-route with Advanced Fusion Technology: Fully automated flow with comprehensive GF 12LP rules support. Deployment of advanced legalizer, pin density-aware placement, total power optimization, logic restructuring, and ECO closure. Design Compiler Graphical and Design Compiler NXT RTL synthesis: Advanced power, performance, and area (PPA) optimizations, congestion reduction, pin access-aware optimization, tight correlation, and physical guidance for IC Compiler II. IC Validator physical signoff: Physical signoff including DRC, LVS, and Fill. Innovative Explorer DRC and Live DRC technologies for enhanced productivity. PrimeTime® timing signoff: Advanced variation modeling for low voltages, and enhanced ECO technologies with support for new physical design rules. StarRC™ extraction signoff: Advanced modeling to handle the complexity of FinFET devices, as well as a common technology file for parasitic extraction consistency from synthesis to place-and-route to signoff."}{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2019-10-10 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'T. Rowe Price Group Reports Preliminary Month-End Assets Under Management For Sept. 2019', 'text': 'T. ROWE PRICE GROUP REPORTS PRELIMINARY MONTH-END ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT FOR SEPTEMBER 2019.T. ROWE PRICE GROUP INC - REPORTED PRELIMINARY MONTH-END ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT OF $1.13 TRILLION AS OF SEPTEMBER 30, 2019.T. ROWE PRICE GROUP INC - TOTAL CLIENT TRANSFERS FOR YEAR-TO-DATE PERIOD ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, TO $19.5 BILLION.T. ROWE PRICE GROUP - CLIENT TRANSFERS FROM MUTUAL FUNDS TO OTHER PORTFOLIOS WERE $5.3 BILLION IN SEPTEMBER 2019, & $7.5 BILLION FOR QUARTER-ENDED SEPT 30, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'TTWO', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc., Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc., Q2 2020 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Target Names Michael Fiddelke As Chief Financial Officer', 'text': 'TARGET NAMES MICHAEL FIDDELKE EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.TARGET CORP - MICHAEL FIDDELKE HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE NOV. 1.TARGET CORP - ANNOUNCES CHANGES TO MERCHANT LEADERSHIP.TARGET CORP - RESIGNATION OF CHIEF MERCHANT MARK TRITTON.TARGET CORP -  CATHY SMITH WILL REMAIN AS A STRATEGIC ADVISOR UNTIL MAY 1, 2020.TARGET CORP - CHRISTINA HENNINGTON & JILL SANDO WILL ASSUME INTERIM LEADERSHIP OF MERCHANDISING ORGANIZATION.'}{'symbol': 'TEL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'TE Connectivity Ltd., Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019', 'text': 'TE Connectivity Ltd., Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 30, 2019'}{'symbol': 'TER', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Teradyne, Inc. to Report Q3, 2019 Results on Oct 22, 2019', 'text': 'Teradyne, Inc. announced that they will report Q3, 2019 results at 5:00 PM, US Eastern Standard Time on Oct 22, 2019'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The BancAnalysts Association of Boston, Inc., BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov 07, 2019 through Nov 08, 2019', 'text': 'The BancAnalysts Association of Boston, Inc., BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov 07, 2019 through Nov 08, 2019. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'U.S. Bancorp Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 11:30 AM', 'text': 'U.S. Bancorp Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 11:30 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: Derek Jensen White, Chief Digital Officer, Terrance R. Dolan, Vice Chairman & CFO.'}{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'United Parcel Service, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 22, 2019', 'text': 'United Parcel Service, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 22, 2019'}{'symbol': 'VRTX', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated (NasdaqGS:VRTX) completed the acquisition of Semma Therapeutics, Inc. from Living Cell Technologies Limited (ASX:LCT) and others.', 'text': 'Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated (NasdaqGS:VRTX) entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Semma Therapeutics, Inc. from Living Cell Technologies Limited (ASX:LCT) and others for approximately $950 million on August 30, 2019. Under the terms of the merger agreement, Vertex has agreed to a payment of approximately $950 million in cash upon consummation of the merger plus an additional payment in respect of certain stock options. A portion of the consideration will be placed in escrow upon the closing of the merger to satisfy certain indemnification obligations of Semma’s equity holders. Any escrow proceeds that are not used to satisfy indemnity claims or secure pending indemnity claims will be released to the former equity holders of Semma, 15 months after the closing of the merger. Under the transaction, Living Cell Technologies Limited will sell 0.12 million shares of Semma. Vertex intends to fund the acquisition using cash on hand or other sources of immediately available funds. Following the transaction, Semma will operate as a separate wholly-owned subsidiary of Vertex. Bastiano Sanna, President and Chief Executive Officer of Semma, will join Vertex as President of Semma. Douglas Melton, Scientific Founder of Semma, will continue in his role as Chairman of Semma’s Scientific Advisory Board. Certain members of Semma’s management team have entered into restrictive covenant agreements with Vertex which will become effective upon consummation of the merger.\n\nThe completion of the merger is subject to certain customary conditions, including the expiration or termination of the applicable waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act of 1976, as amended, and the absence of any material adverse effect with respect to Semma. The transaction has been approved by the Board of Directors of Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated and Semma Therapeutics and the stockholders of Semma including Living Cell Technologies Limited, which intends to vote in favour of the transaction. As of October 3, 2019, FTC granted the early termination notice. The transaction is expected to be completed in the fourth quarter of 2019. Graham Robinson, Faiz Ahmad, Moshe Spinowitz and Maya Florence of Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher & Flom LLP acted as legal advisors to Vertex. Wilson Sonsini Goodrich & Rosati, P.C. acted as legal advisor to Semma. Kingsley L. Taft and Danielle M. Lauzon of Goodwin Procter LLP acted as legal advisors to Semma.\nVertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated (NasdaqGS:VRTX) completed the acquisition of Semma Therapeutics, Inc. from Living Cell Technologies Limited (ASX:LCT) and others on October 10, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Gregory S. Foran to Continue as an Executive Vice President of Walmart Inc', 'text': 'Walmart Inc. announced that beginning on November 1, 2019, Mr. Foran will continue to be employed by the Company and serve as an Executive Vice President of the Company in a transitional role reporting to the Company’s President and Chief Executive Officer until January 31, 2020, at which time his employment with the Company will end. Mr. Foran has served as Executive Vice President, President and Chief Executive Officer of the Company’s Walmart U.S. segment since August 2014.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wells Fargo & Company Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 07:30 AM', 'text': 'Wells Fargo & Company Presents at BancAnalysts Association of Boston Conference, Nov-08-2019 07:30 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Speakers: Zachary Maufe, Chief Data Officer.'}{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. to Report Q3, 2019 Results on Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. announced that they will report Q3, 2019 results at 9:00 AM, Eastern Standard Time on Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'WHR', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Holger Gottstein to Join Whirlpool Corporation as Senior Vice President of Strategy and Business Development, as Well as the Company's Executive Committee", 'text': "Effective January 1, 2020, Holger Gottstein will join Whirlpool Corporation as senior vice president of strategy and business development, as well as the company's executive committee. In this role, Gottstein will lead strategy and business planning processes for Whirlpool Corporation, including mergers and acquisitions, new business development, and other strategic initiatives. He will work across the organization, partnering with others to push the company's digital consumer journey forward. Gottstein will be based at Whirlpool Corporation headquarters in Benton Harbor, Mich. Gottstein joins Whirlpool Corporation from Boston Consulting Group, where he served as managing director & senior partner and has held various leadership roles across Europe, Asia, and North America in the Consumer and Retail Practice. He brings extensive expertise in digital and direct-to-consumer strategies, mergers, acquisitions and divestitures, and performance improvement."}{'symbol': 'WLTW', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Willis Towers Watson Public Limited Company Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-16-2019 09:15 AM', 'text': 'Willis Towers Watson Public Limited Company Presents at 10th Annual Insurance M&A Symposium, Oct-16-2019 09:15 AM. Venue: Current at Pier 59, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Sean McDermott, Senior Director.'}